      "madeNote": "ported to GSAP on the film's clock; same timings, eases, sizes and colours; the original is linked",
      "sourceText": "magicuidesign/magicui at efe76fc, apps/www/registry/magicui/text-reveal.tsx",
      "upstream": null
    },
    "thirdParty": [],
